OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK says a "deal is done" with Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham in Brussels today
OL,9,Ffor talks to secure a new UK-EU
OL,10,Fagreement covering issues such as youth
OL,11,Fmobility, food exports, carbon
OL,12,Femissions and migration
OL,14,FBut the EU has demanded the PM agree to
OL,15,Fcut university tuition fees for
OL,16,FEuropean students, with Britain given
OL,17,Fsix months to agree or negotiate an
OL,18,Falternative
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
