OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK also says "talks will continue
OL,8,Fin some areas", with more detail to be
OL,9,Fset out in a joint statement later
OL,10,Ftoday - we are expecting to hear from
OL,11,FBurnham and EU leaders in a press
OL,12,Fconference at about 12:30 GMT
OL,14,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected
OL,15,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the
OL,16,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK
OL,17,Fper year - the same number of young
OL,18,FBritons would be allowed into Europe
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
