OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,8,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,9,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,10,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,11,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,12,Fare saying
